  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OHADA - Institutional Capacity-Building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Capacity Building in OHADA  The objective of this Grant was to strengthen the institutional capacity of the Organisation pour l&apos;Harmonisation en Afrique du Droit des Affaires (OHADA) generally and its Permanent Secretariat in particular, in order to enable the promotion and implementation of OHADA uniform laws in all member states through the identification of: (i) issues and roadblocks preventing the implementation of OHADA&apos;s uniform laws across the OHADA member states; (ii) actions needed to foster effective and consistent implementation of these laws in all member states; and (iii) key institutional strengthening activities to ensure the sustainable capacity-building of OHADA&apos;s Permanent Secretariat.</narrative>
  </description>
